# and NOTICE are next to this patch. Apply it with `patch -p1` in a directory that holds the upstream files
# (the zeta23 folder). Files not listed here are used unchanged.
#
# Changes, all forced by Mathlib API drift between the two versions:
# - FromPNTPlus/StrongPNTPrefix: Finset.prod_le_prod → prod_le_prod₀ (renamed).
# - FromPNTPlus/EulerMaclaurin: import Mathlib.MeasureTheory.Function.Floor directly (AbelSummation no longer
#   re-exports it).
# - Analytic/RectangleLogDeriv, RvM/GammaSide, WeilEF/GammaRBracket: logDeriv_mul → logDeriv_fun_mul (the
#   pointwise form got the new name).
# - WeilEF/Landau: logDeriv_prod → logDeriv_fun_prod (the same); Finset.prod_le_prod → prod_le_prod₀ and
#   Finset.prod_le_one → prod_le_one₀ (renamed).
